# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# APK BUILD ENVIRONMENT — Configure for Production
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your deployed backend URL (Render, Railway, or VPS)
# IMPORTANT: Replace with your actual deployed backend URL
# Examples:
#   Render:  https://navbus-api.onrender.com
#   Railway: https://navbus-production.up.railway.app
#   VPS:     https://api.yourdomain.com
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://navbus-v.onrender.com

# Google Maps API Key (optional but recommended)
# Get your key from: https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/get-api-key
# Without this, the map will show a placeholder
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=AIzaSyC3J8SwflNHo61Jwfm4HXTc0xGdiImBVy0

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BUILD INSTRUCTIONS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Deploy the backend (see backend/DEPLOY.md)
# 2. Copy your backend URL to VITE_BACKEND_URL above
# 3. (Optional) Add your Google Maps API key
# 4. Run: npm run android:build
# 5. Open Android Studio: npm run cap:open
# 6. Build APK in Android Studio or run on device
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
